---
import graphic from '../../assets/ui/shapes/orange-blurs.svg?url';
---

<section class="about-us" aria-labelledby="about-us-heading">
  <div class="text-column">
  <h2 id="about-us-heading">More About Us</h2>

  <div class="triangle-text top-left">
    <div class="spacer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <p>
      Founded in 2017, UNSW DataSoc is Australia’s first and largest
      student data science society. We bring together mathematicians,
      econometricians, computer scientists and anyone curious about data.
      Each year, we run events that support students in their studies and 
      careers and also host social events open to everyone at UNSW.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h3 id="our-values-heading">Our Goals</h3>
  <div class="triangle-text bottom-right" aria-labelledby="our-values-heading">
    <div class="value-row">
    <img src="/who-we-are/lightbulb-idea.png" alt="" class="value-icon" />
    <p>
      <span class="goal-line">We aim to be Australia’s leading student-run society,</span>
      <span class="goal-line">helping students achieve their data science career goals.</span>
    </p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-row">
    <img src="/who-we-are/bulletin-board.png" alt="" class="value-icon" />
    <p>
      We create opportunities
      through information sessions, networking evenings and career-focused events.
    </p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-row">
    <img src="/who-we-are/graphic-design.png" alt="" class="value-icon" />
    <p>
      We build community through BBQs, competitions and social activities that
      welcome everyone at UNSW.
    </p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-row">
    <img src="/who-we-are/zoom.png" alt="" class="value-icon" />
    <p>
      We also support students in their studies through
      help sessions, workshops and peer support.
    </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>

  <div class="graphic-layer" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src={graphic} alt="" />
  </div>
</section>


<style>
  /* Scale with the homepage background, as LatestEvents does.
     Sizes preserve the design's proportions at a 1440px viewport. */
  .about-us {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    min-height: 55vw;
    overflow-x: clip;
  }

  .triangle-text {
    display: flow-root;
  }

  .text-column {
    position: relative;
    top: 1vw;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 44%;
    padding: 3.3333vw 1.6667vw;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .triangle-text p {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-inter), sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.1111vw;
    line-height: 1.65;
    letter-spacing: normal;
  }

  .spacer {
    width: 100%;
    height: 16.6667vw;
    shape-margin: 0.4167vw;
  }

  /* Text starts wide and gets narrower downward. */
  .top-left .spacer {
    float: right;
    shape-outside: polygon(100% 0, 100% 100%, 45% 100%);
  }

  /* Step each goal right while keeping its text beside the icon. */
  .bottom-right {
    position: relative;
    left: 1vw;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.3889vw;
  }

  .bottom-right p {
    text-align: right;
  }

  .value-row {
    width: 100%;
    margin-left: auto;
    padding-left: 0.5vw;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.1111vw;
  }

  .value-icon {
    flex: 0 0 3.3333vw;
    width: 3.3333vw;
    height: 3.3333vw;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .value-row > p {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .goal-line {
    display: block;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .value-row:nth-child(2) {
    width: 96%;
  }

  .value-row:nth-child(3) {
    width: 92%;
  }

  .value-row:nth-child(4) {
    width: 88%;
  }

  h2, h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-inter), sans-serif;
    font-size: 2.2917vw;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #ed4669;
    margin: 0 0 1.6667vw;
  }

  h3 {
    position: relative;
    left: 1vw;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.4167vw;
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 1.8056vw;
  }

  p {
    font-family: var(--font-inter), sans-serif;
    position: relative;
    text-align: left;
    color: #ed4669;
  }

  .graphic-layer {
    position: absolute;
    top: 5.5556vw;
    right: 0;
    width: 58%;
    z-index: -1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .graphic-layer img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }


</style>

